WEBVTT

02:47.610 --> 02:48.770
<i>Seems like the police...</i>

02:49.310 --> 02:51.770
...somehow found out that Juval was killed.

02:52.100 --> 02:54.110
They're sending in a security force.

02:54.110 --> 02:55.650
You don't want to tangle with them.

02:55.960 --> 02:56.780
<i>Get out before—</i>

02:56.780 --> 02:57.790
I won't run.

02:58.270 --> 02:59.150
<i>What?</i>

03:00.280 --> 03:01.790
I didn't do it.

03:02.240 --> 03:04.810
<i>It doesn't matter who did it!</i>

03:04.810 --> 03:08.840
<i>The police here only want 
an excuse to crush the CFN!</i>

03:09.850 --> 03:11.540
They have an informant.

03:12.000 --> 03:15.160
<i>And you think it might be Phantom Verde?</i>

03:15.160 --> 03:17.620
<i>I guess it could be possible...</i>

03:17.620 --> 03:19.050
So I won't run.

03:19.320 --> 03:22.410
If I stay here, he'll come to me on his own.

03:22.940 --> 03:27.350
Then I can take out Phantom Verde, 
as ordered, and retrieve his id.

03:29.420 --> 03:32.010
<i>Are you... really Rouge?</i>

03:33.480 --> 03:34.800
I am Rouge.

03:36.720 --> 03:39.910
<i>Boy, you really have grown up this time.</i>

03:41.400 --> 03:42.380
<i>Shut up!</i>

03:42.380 --> 03:44.300
Okay, fine. I'll head over—

03:44.300 --> 03:45.580
<i>You don't have to!</i>

03:45.890 --> 03:47.710
I <i>want</i> to.

03:47.710 --> 03:51.480
I want to go there and help you. 
Let me help you!

03:51.480 --> 03:52.290
<i>Huh?</i>

03:52.780 --> 03:55.340
This is my own free will talking.

03:55.340 --> 03:59.670
Because I'm not some tool for Aletheia, 
and neither are you!

04:02.660 --> 04:06.050
Oh, fine. I'll wait for you, then.

04:19.280 --> 04:22.750
We are at a loss without our leader.

04:22.750 --> 04:24.340
I can imagine.

04:24.340 --> 04:27.570
I would like to hear what happened 
once more, in detail.

04:27.880 --> 04:29.700
I'd like to hear from you, too.

04:30.080 --> 04:32.730
There's no point asking her anything.

04:32.730 --> 04:34.640
We should execute her right now.

04:34.640 --> 04:38.580
As I've told you many times, 
we don't know yet that she's the killer.

04:38.580 --> 04:39.380
Besides...

04:39.960 --> 04:42.170
Neans don't kill other Neans.

04:42.510 --> 04:45.720
We're supposed to trust 
an unknown Nean like her?

04:45.720 --> 04:48.230
If we just get rid of things 
we're unfamiliar with,

04:48.650 --> 04:51.620
that'll make us no different 
from the humans.

04:51.620 --> 04:54.010
She might be working with the Alters!

04:54.010 --> 04:56.270
And I'm saying we need to find out 
whether she is or not!

04:56.270 --> 04:57.690
Please calm down.

04:59.420 --> 05:02.010
Forgive us. May we begin 
the interrogation now?

05:02.510 --> 05:04.690
You will whether I agree or not, won't you?

05:04.690 --> 05:06.270
Why were you in that place?

05:06.270 --> 05:07.460
I was called there.

05:07.790 --> 05:09.890
Juval invited you there himself?

05:09.890 --> 05:11.590
I got a message.

05:11.910 --> 05:13.660
Who delivered the message?

05:15.460 --> 05:17.590
First platoon, subdue point A.

05:17.590 --> 05:19.750
Second platoon, you will subdue point B.

05:20.350 --> 05:23.120
Apprehend all members of the CFN.

05:23.120 --> 05:25.710
Destroy them if you need to.

05:26.330 --> 05:27.320
Now, charge!

05:28.720 --> 05:29.750
What's the problem?

05:29.750 --> 05:31.160
Why won't you answer?

05:31.160 --> 05:34.370
If you're innocent, you need 
to tell us the truth.

05:34.860 --> 05:36.750
Are you covering for someone?

05:37.070 --> 05:39.530
Silence won't help you, you know.

05:42.090 --> 05:46.120
Very well. I'll start my line of questioning 
over from the beginning.

05:46.880 --> 05:47.780
What's your name?

05:49.570 --> 05:50.780
What's your name?

05:51.560 --> 05:53.430
Rouge Redstar.

05:53.430 --> 05:54.940
Your date of creation?

05:55.630 --> 05:56.660
I don't know.

05:56.660 --> 05:58.350
Did you come here from Earth?

06:00.170 --> 06:02.420
You're an agent of Aletheia, yes?

06:12.290 --> 06:14.720
This is your first time coming 
to this settlement, I'm sure.

06:15.070 --> 06:16.180
What did you see?

06:17.570 --> 06:18.900
What did you feel?

06:20.580 --> 06:22.360
When you saw the Neans trapped here,

06:22.360 --> 06:25.420
robbed of even their freedom to die...

06:27.650 --> 06:32.190
Juval asked you to become 
the Neans' hope, didn't he?

06:35.510 --> 06:38.180
Did you not feel the desire to save them?

06:38.500 --> 06:39.810
That's...

06:39.810 --> 06:42.670
...not your job, is it?

06:43.660 --> 06:45.880
It seems Juval was wrong about you.

06:46.670 --> 06:48.760
You can't save the Neans.

06:49.370 --> 06:51.510
You're just as confined as we are.

06:52.750 --> 06:57.450
You should live more freely, 
in accordance with your own desires.

06:57.450 --> 07:02.840
Kill who you want to kill, 
and save who you want to save!

07:02.840 --> 07:04.190
If you'd done that,

07:04.190 --> 07:07.270
maybe you could've saved 
Sarah Fitzgerald, too.

07:07.890 --> 07:10.660
You liked her singing, didn't you?

07:12.150 --> 07:13.410
You're...

07:15.970 --> 07:16.860
No!

07:25.610 --> 07:27.660
Look! She broke her shackles!

07:27.660 --> 07:30.930
She tried to kill us!

07:29.820 --> 07:30.930
Th-That's right!

07:31.280 --> 07:33.010
She tried to attack us!

07:35.710 --> 07:36.970
Kill her.

07:37.490 --> 07:38.810
Kill her!

07:38.060 --> 07:38.810
Stop!

07:40.440 --> 07:43.590
Stop this. I don't want to hurt any of you.

07:48.480 --> 07:49.630
Move!

07:55.810 --> 07:57.120
The security force!

07:57.120 --> 07:58.830
Shit! Run for it!

08:09.890 --> 08:11.360
Stop right there!

08:13.390 --> 08:14.620
On your knees!

08:17.650 --> 08:19.660
Third floor subdued.

08:23.820 --> 08:26.720
I've located Juval 087.

08:33.870 --> 08:34.950
Get real!

08:34.950 --> 08:36.990
We can't run and leave Juval here!

08:36.990 --> 08:38.730
There's no other choice now!

08:38.730 --> 08:40.760
What are you doing? We gotta get out—

08:41.500 --> 08:42.550
Halt!

08:51.960 --> 08:53.740
All of you run, too!

08:54.840 --> 08:55.970
Let's go, people!

08:58.020 --> 08:59.140
Halt!

09:02.650 --> 09:03.690
Rouge!

09:04.480 --> 09:05.270
Rion?

09:05.270 --> 09:07.380
The building is surrounded.

09:07.380 --> 09:08.820
This way! Hurry!

09:09.530 --> 09:10.680
Now!

09:13.820 --> 09:14.740
Damn it!

09:15.360 --> 09:17.030
I lost Dumas!

09:21.010 --> 09:23.370
<i>Are you serious, Investigator Ash?</i>

09:23.580 --> 09:26.230
A security force was deployed 
to the Nean settlement.

09:26.230 --> 09:27.850
That's a big deal.

09:27.850 --> 09:30.260
You think it's connected 
to the suspect in red?

09:30.260 --> 09:32.080
Is this your intuition again?

09:32.080 --> 09:33.380
And how do we get inside?

09:34.100 --> 09:36.380
Who do you think we are?

09:36.970 --> 09:38.590
We're Ochrona.

09:38.590 --> 09:41.600
Must be nice to have authority!

09:44.520 --> 09:48.570
Why don't you let me in on this, too?

10:07.740 --> 10:08.540
This way!

10:13.190 --> 10:17.430
The suspect in red that you're after 
is inside the Nean settlement.

10:17.430 --> 10:18.990
How do you know?

10:19.540 --> 10:21.860
You're from Aletheia, aren't you?

10:21.860 --> 10:27.390
My job is to search for the special 
Nean that can take on a red form.

10:27.660 --> 10:29.470
It's a Nean?

10:29.470 --> 10:32.900
Can't you just use Aletheia's authority 
to get into the settlement?

10:33.280 --> 10:35.450
Well, see, it's a top secret mission.

10:35.450 --> 10:37.900
So I can't be too bold about it.

10:37.900 --> 10:42.410
But since you and I are 
after the same guy...

10:42.590 --> 10:43.910
What's in it for me?

10:44.590 --> 10:47.910
The identity of the suspect in red, maybe?

10:49.170 --> 10:51.870
I honestly loathe Aletheia...

10:51.870 --> 10:54.050
But okay. I'm in.

11:02.580 --> 11:03.720
Wait a moment!

11:03.940 --> 11:06.070
We can't open the gate without permission!

11:06.070 --> 11:07.570
We need to contact our bosses.

11:07.570 --> 11:09.740
The guy we're after is no joke!

11:09.740 --> 11:12.380
The security force could be in danger, too!

11:12.380 --> 11:14.730
It'll be too late once something happens!

11:14.730 --> 11:17.050
The one inside the settlement

11:17.050 --> 11:19.990
is a suspect in the killing of Roy Junghardt.

11:21.560 --> 11:23.710
If you refuse to cooperate 
with Ochrona's investigation

11:23.710 --> 11:25.670
and let the suspect get away,

11:25.670 --> 11:28.000
you will be expected to take responsibility.

11:30.410 --> 11:31.500
Open the gate.

11:34.300 --> 11:36.190
Thank you for your cooperation.

11:39.670 --> 11:42.810
I might just get drunk on power...

11:44.440 --> 11:45.970
Once you go through here,

11:46.400 --> 11:48.770
you'll be in the southern end of Wellstown.

11:49.000 --> 11:50.980
There might be guards posted,

11:50.980 --> 11:53.960
but with your abilities, you should be fine.

12:01.720 --> 12:03.870
Doesn't look like we can get any closer.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.780
Yo, Aletheia.

12:11.780 --> 12:15.250
Do you actually know who 
the suspect in red is?

12:15.250 --> 12:16.210
Er...

12:16.710 --> 12:18.510
It appears she's fled.

12:19.690 --> 12:22.640
What do you mean, "with my abilities"?

12:23.010 --> 12:26.510
Well, you're a special Nean, aren't you?

12:26.870 --> 12:30.220
Didn't you think I was a human?

12:30.720 --> 12:32.610
How do you know I'm a Nean?

12:32.610 --> 12:33.480
Huh?

12:35.660 --> 12:41.150
Uh... Someone in the CFN told me... I think.

12:41.420 --> 12:43.400
You're not from the CFN.

12:43.960 --> 12:45.430
Why were you there?

12:46.280 --> 12:49.240
Did Juval really ask you to come get me?

12:51.140 --> 12:54.060
You knew Juval was dead, didn't you?

12:55.970 --> 12:58.100
You killed Juval.

12:58.100 --> 12:59.970
I thought maybe Dumas did, but...

12:59.970 --> 13:01.210
I didn't!

13:05.460 --> 13:08.380
Are you looking for someone?

13:10.140 --> 13:11.660
I didn't kill him!

13:11.660 --> 13:13.730
I was just told to bring you back!

13:14.040 --> 13:14.810
By whom?

13:17.110 --> 13:19.540
I only wanted to help.

13:20.000 --> 13:21.940
If there was anything I could do,

13:22.520 --> 13:24.520
I wanted to do it.

13:26.280 --> 13:29.390
I didn't want to see him suffer.

13:30.170 --> 13:30.740
So I—

14:15.130 --> 14:17.270
No! I'm not like you!

14:17.270 --> 14:19.410
I'm not the same as...

14:26.200 --> 14:27.260
What?

14:29.820 --> 14:31.890
Code... Eve?

14:34.570 --> 14:36.060
It's your fault.

14:36.380 --> 14:39.290
I heard that Juval was 
acting like a good guy

14:39.290 --> 14:41.440
while killing the Neans in his way,

14:41.440 --> 14:43.300
and that you were working for him.

14:43.300 --> 14:43.920
N-No, I—

14:43.920 --> 14:46.950
And that your true identity 
is that of a crimson devil,

14:46.950 --> 14:49.220
stained in the blood of your fellow Neans!

15:03.500 --> 15:06.970
Honestly, I was hoping to 
take out Rouge, but...

15:08.310 --> 15:10.330
My desires are soaring now.

15:10.330 --> 15:13.320
And you should be true to your desires!

15:13.320 --> 15:17.270
Honest! Sincere! Straightforward!

15:17.270 --> 15:20.770
When you want to kill, 
to massacre, to destroy...

15:20.770 --> 15:23.770
You shouldn't suppress that!

15:27.130 --> 15:31.070
But life is an inconvenient thing 
that never goes the way we want.

15:31.590 --> 15:34.170
If you're an adult, you need 
to suppress such urges.

15:34.170 --> 15:35.630
Exactly.

15:35.630 --> 15:39.180
So I'll just settle for an alternative!

15:40.640 --> 15:41.790
Oh?

15:42.550 --> 15:47.590
Looks like you're someone 
who's gonna be real trouble.

15:53.710 --> 15:54.750
Rouge...

15:55.300 --> 15:56.270
Rouge.

16:06.490 --> 16:08.280
You're still resisting?

16:09.190 --> 16:11.070
Impressive.

16:11.860 --> 16:13.230
You're...

16:14.850 --> 16:16.720
Doctor Afdal!

16:17.640 --> 16:19.580
The informant Juval mentioned—

16:19.580 --> 16:21.340
The doctor isn't a bad guy!

16:21.340 --> 16:23.020
He just got caught up in this!

16:23.020 --> 16:25.840
Dumas asked him for help killing Juval!

16:26.430 --> 16:31.000
But he didn't want to... and I 
couldn't let the doctor do that!

16:32.130 --> 16:36.160
Doctor... I did everything right.

16:36.160 --> 16:38.440
You're free now.

16:38.440 --> 16:40.430
Please take me with you!

16:40.430 --> 16:42.510
I want to be just like you,

16:42.510 --> 16:45.230
and help everyone, together with you.

16:45.500 --> 16:47.260
I want to be free, too!

16:48.780 --> 16:51.280
That's all just an illusion.

16:51.540 --> 16:52.690
Huh?

16:52.690 --> 16:55.160
It wasn't that I didn't want to,

16:55.160 --> 16:57.870
and neither did I ask for your help.

16:58.250 --> 17:01.700
You just assumed that 
and did it all on your own.

17:02.630 --> 17:03.790
Doctor—

17:08.810 --> 17:12.360
I'm not the man you think I am.

17:12.860 --> 17:17.080
Getting into the settlement 
and monitoring the CFN,

17:17.080 --> 17:19.510
saving those Neans...

17:19.850 --> 17:23.770
I was just carrying out 
the task assigned to me.

17:25.270 --> 17:27.420
Freedom is an illusion, too.

17:28.580 --> 17:31.480
There's no such thing as 
freedom in the outside world.

17:31.800 --> 17:34.990
Humans aren't free, either.

17:35.550 --> 17:36.760
Of course,

17:37.300 --> 17:42.410
they don't realize it, and that might 
make them more foolish than us.

17:51.780 --> 17:53.110
Afdal!

17:55.530 --> 17:56.810
Electromagnetic interference...

17:56.810 --> 17:58.180
No doubt about it.

17:58.180 --> 18:00.510
The red jerk is here.

18:01.700 --> 18:02.650
Rouge...

18:02.650 --> 18:05.270
Well, it seems the show has begun.

18:05.550 --> 18:09.400
Sadly, we won't be able 
to see it, but next time,

18:09.400 --> 18:11.780
we'll be sure to get the best seats.

18:13.150 --> 18:16.140
Adieu, uh...

18:16.140 --> 18:17.820
Who were you again?

18:18.550 --> 18:21.580
Naomi. Naomi Orthmann.

18:23.440 --> 18:25.890
Adieu, Naomi.

19:05.520 --> 19:09.290
You and I are both to be pitied.

19:14.500 --> 19:15.990
This fog...

19:15.990 --> 19:17.290
Yes.

19:17.290 --> 19:22.160
This is a nerve gas 
generated within my body.

19:22.160 --> 19:25.100
I never wanted to be born 
in a body like this.

19:25.550 --> 19:27.270
This isn't enough to...

19:27.620 --> 19:29.360
Just stop fighting it.

19:29.360 --> 19:32.480
You and I are both to be pitied.

19:32.690 --> 19:35.990
We aren't the same! I don't need pity!

19:39.690 --> 19:42.830
You also desire freedom.

19:42.830 --> 19:45.520
You're just like Rion and me!

19:46.480 --> 19:47.250
You're wrong...

19:47.630 --> 19:51.480
There is only one way to attain freedom.

19:51.480 --> 19:53.330
You're wrong... You're wrong...

19:53.740 --> 19:55.120
You're wrong!

20:09.560 --> 20:11.390
Why do you resist?

20:14.230 --> 20:16.560
Become free, Rouge!

20:19.970 --> 20:21.360
Verde!

20:49.810 --> 20:51.160
That's right...

20:51.490 --> 20:57.900
For both you and I... to be free...

20:57.900 --> 21:00.000

